{"id":"u-39c5e542-93c1-4d26-8ab0-c02eb19a70e3","src":"community","title":"Jay's Science Based For Maximum Muscle growth","author":"Jayden W.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/WQuwmC-trainingprogram","desc":"This program is designed to maximize muscle growth and strength by training each muscle group twice per week — once with heavy, primary volume (Push/Pull/Legs) and once with a lighter secondary dose (Upper/Lower). Research consistently shows that hitting a muscle 2x/week drives better results than training it just once, even at the same total weekly volume. By combining PPL and Upper/Lower into a hybrid 5-day split, the program delivers enough volume (roughly 11–16 sets per muscle per week) to drive progress, while still allowing two full rest days for recovery. Progressive overload — adding reps, weight, or sets over time — is the core driver of long-term gains, supported by structured RIR targets, adequate rest periods, and scheduled deloads to manage fatigue.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-09T14:49:01.536Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push (Primary)","Pull (Primary)","Legs (Primary)","Upper (Secondary)","Lower (Secondary)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi